rl see?", "end": 462.26}, {"start": 462.26, "text": "古英语能不能说What see the girl?", "end": 465.26}, {"start": 465.26, "text": "什么看到女生?", "end": 467.91}, {"start": 467.91, "text": "古英语可以。", "end": 468.91}, {"start": 468.91, "text": "指的就是她看到什么。", "end": 469.91}, {"start": 469.91, "text": "但现代英语为了避免混淆。", "end": 472.91}, {"start": 472.91, "text": "以为你问了什么看到女生。", "end": 474.91}, {"start": 474.91, "text": "所以他们统一用什么do。", "end": 476.91}, {"start": 476.91, "text": "作为这个什么问的角度。", "end": 479.44}, {"start": 479.44, "text": "再说事情。", "end": 480.44}, {"start": 480.44, "text": "所以是什么?", "end": 481.44}, {"start": 481.44, "text": "What does the girl see?", "end": 483.44}, {"start": 483.44, "text": "在看这方面她做了啥?", "end": 485.44}, {"start": 485.44, "text": "也就是她看了啥?", "end": 487.44}, {"start": 487.44, "text": "What does the girl see?", "end": 488.44}, {"start": 488.44, "text": "补充信息through the window of the plane。", "end": 491.44}, {"start": 491.44, "text": "通过飞机的窗户。", "end": 494.06}, {"start": 494.06, "text": "What does she see?", "end": 496.06}, {"start": 496.06, "text": "这问的是现在。", "end": 497.06}, {"start": 497.06, "text": "She sees other airplanes。", "end": 499.06}, {"start": 499.06, "text": "看到别的飞机。", "end": 500.06}, {"start": 500.06, "text": "鸟是爬升的时候。", "end": 502.06}, {"start": 502.06, "text": "那就是What did the girl see?", "end": 504.06}, {"start": 504.06, "text": "Do的过去是。", "end": 505.06}, {"start": 505.06, "text": "这个是第三方的现在是。", "end": 507.06}, {"start": 507.06, "text": "Does。", "end": 508.06}, {"start": 508.06, "text": "记住s的尾音。", "end": 510.06}, {"start": 510.06, "text": "说明是第三方个体。", "end": 512.06}, {"start": 512.06, "text": "What does the girl see?", "end": 513.06}, {"start": 513.06, "text": "如果是你。", "end": 514.06}, {"start": 514.06, "text": "如果是你。", "end": 515.06}, {"start": 515.06, "text": "那就是What do you see?", "end": 517.06}, {"start": 517.06, "text": "如果是瑞杰老师。", "end": 518.06}, {"start": 518.06, "text": "What do I see?", "end": 519.06}, {"start": 519.06, "text": "如果是第三方。", "e