rt": 579.66, "text": "She saw some birds outside the window.", "end": 582.66}, {"start": 582.66, "text": "Do birds go 10,000 feet in the air?", "end": 586.79}, {"start": 586.79, "text": "No, birds do not go 10,000 feet in the air.", "end": 589.79}, {"start": 589.79, "text": "Airplanes do.", "end": 591.79}, {"start": 591.79, "text": "所以你看多可爱。", "end": 593.79}, {"start": 593.79, "text": "这个不知道是Mary还是谁出门了。", "end": 595.79}, {"start": 595.79, "text": "Maybe, we don't know.", "end": 597.79}, {"start": 597.79, "text": "又是一篇阅读运用。", "end": 599.79}, {"start": 599.79, "text": "挺好的。", "end": 600.79}, {"start": 600.79, "text": "好,你们的阅读能力越来越强了。", "end": 604.79}, {"start": 604.79, "text": "我们在下一个情景中再巩固一遍最近学的东西。", "end": 608.79}, {"start": 608.79, "text": "Here we go.", "end": 609.79}, {"start": 609.79, "text": "In this picture.", "end": 615.18}, {"start": 615.18, "text": "我们记得Picture这个词最早接触是在Picture over the shelves,对吧?", "end": 621.18}, {"start": 621.18, "text": "墙上有一个Picture,它在一个Frame里面。", "end": 624.18}, {"start": 624.18, "text": "The picture is in a frame.", "end": 627.18}, {"start": 627.18, "text": "现在我们都是直接就在上照片了。", "end": 630.18}, {"start": 630.18, "text": "所以叫做In this picture.", "end": 635.03}, {"start": 635.03, "text": "You see a girl at a window.", "end": 638.03}, {"start": 638.03, "text": "So this girl is at a window.", "end": 641.03}, {"start": 641.03, "text": "You see it.", "end": 642.03}, {"start": 642.03, "text": "You see a girl at a window.", "end": 644.03}, {"start": 644.03, "text": "The glass of the window is cold.", "end": 647.53}, {"start": 647.53, "text": "好了。", "end": 648.53}, {"start": 648.53, "text": "而且老师之前说什么?", "end": 649.53}, {"start": 649.53, "text": "玻璃杯叫glass。", "end": 651.99}, {"start": 651.99, "text": "因为玻璃叫glass。", "end": 652.99}, {"start": 652.99, "text": "那因为最常见的玻璃就是玻璃杯。", "end": 655.99}, {"start": 655.99, "text": "所以glass指的就是什么?", "end": 657.99}, {"start": 657.99, "text": "玻璃杯。", "end": 658.99}, {"start": 658.99, "text": "它是个延伸译。", "end": 659.99}, {"start": 659.99, "text": "但是glass的原意是什么?", "end": 660.99}, {"start": 660.99, "text": "This is glass.", "end": 662.99}, {"start": 662.99, "text": "This is a glass window.", "end": 665.99}, {"start": 665.99, "text": "那因为window的一部分是glass。", "end": 667.99}, {"start": 667.99, "text": "所以下一句说什么?", "end": 668.99}, {"start": 668.99, "text": "The glass of the window.", "end": 671.99}, {"start": 671.99, "text": "我们都知道of是什么?", "end": 673.52}, {"start": 673.52, "text": "后面一个概念是前一个概念的母概念,对吧?", "end": 677.52}, {"start": 677.52, "text": "所以是the window the glass.", "end": 679.52}, {"start": 679.52, "text": "The glass of the window is cold.", "end": 684.18}, {"start": 684.18, "text": "But the girl's breath is warm.", "end": 687.18}, {"start": 687.18, "text": "What is a breath?", "end": 690.15}, {"start": 691.15, "text": "想一下。", "end": 692.15}, {"start": 692.15, "text": "那个定义怎么说来着?", "end": 695.86}, {"start": 695.86, "text": "If we take in air and give out air.", "end": 704.14}, {"start": 704.14, "text": "Give out, take in.", "end": 706.14}, {"start": 706.14, "text": "Give out, take in.", "end": 708.14}, {"start": 708.14, "text": "Through our nose and mouth that is warm air.", "end": 714.61}, {"start": 714.61, "text": "或者breath,对吧?", "end": 716.61}, {"start": 716.61, "text": "我们说什么?", "end": 717.61}, {"start": 717.61, "text": "呼吸。", "end": 718.61}, {"start": 718.61, "text": "呼吸。", "end": 720.1}, {"start": 720.1, "text": "呼吸。", "end": 721.1}, {"start": 721.1, "text": "So if we take in air and give out air.", "end": 724.1}, {"start": 724.1, "text": "Through our nose and mouth that is breath.", "end": 729.1}, {"start": 729.1, "text": "再表演一次。", "end": 730.1}, {"start": 730.1, "text": "Cold, hot, warm, cool.", "end": 736.73}, {"start": 736.73, "text": "所以cool跟warm也很微妙。", "end": 738.73}, {"start": 738.73, "text": "让我们很舒缓的这种温度叫warm。", "end": 741.73}, {"start": 741.73, "text": "让我们很热的时候降温的叫什么cool。", "end": 744.73}, {"start": 744.73, "text": "过冷又有叫什么cold。", "end": 747.73}, {"start": 747.73, "text": "所以breath is warm。", "end": 751.61}, {"start": 751.61, "text": "所以这里强调了一个反差。", "end": 753.61}, {"start": 753.61, "text": "The glass of the window is cold.", "end": 755.61}, {"start": 755.61, "text": "But the girl's breath is warm.", "end": 758.61}, {"start": 758.61, "text": "It is turning to water on the cold window.", "end": 763.79}, {"start": 763.79, "text": "The breath。", "end": 764.79}, {"start": 764.79, "text": "我们呼出来的气或者说吐出来的气。", "end": 769.12}, {"start": 769.12, "text": "本质上也是一种什么?", "end": 771.12}, {"start": 771.12, "text": "Steam。", "end": 772.12}, {"start": 772.12, "text": "想起来了吗?", "end": 773.12}, {"start": 773.12, "text": "水的三太怎么说?", "end": 775.12}, {"start": 775.12, "text": "Water, ice, steam.", "end": 778.12}, {"start": 778.12, "text": "It's giving out steam。", "end": 780.12}, {"start": 780.12, "text": "记得吗?那个pot。", "end": 782.12}, {"start": 782.12, "text": "它这里说什么?", "end": 783.12}, {"start": 783.12, "text": "It is turning to water。", "end": 785.12}, {"start": 785.12, "text": "说的是女生的breath。", "end": 787.12}, {"start": 787.12, "text": "breath干嘛?变回水啦。", "end": 789.12}, {"start": 789.12, "text": "变回液态啦。", "end": 790.12}, {"start": 790.12, "text": "It's liquid。", "end": 791.12}, {"start": 791.12, "text": "液态。", "end": 792.12}, {"start": 792.12, "text": "这时候就叫什么?", "end": 793.12}, {"start": 793.12, "text": "It is turning to water.", "end": 796.12}, {"start": 796.12, "text": "Turning。", "end": 797.12}, {"start": 797.12, "text": "它转变了。", "end": 798.12}, {"start": 798.12, "text": "Turning into water.", "end": 804.12}, {"start": 804.12, "text": "所以干嘛?", "end": 805.12}, {"start": 805.12, "text": "这个水气steam或者说女生的breath。", "end": 808.12}, {"start": 808.12, "text": "Is turning into water.", "end": 811.12}, {"start": 811.12, "text": "It is turning into water on the cold window.", "end": 815.12}, {"start": 815.12, "text": "所以干嘛?", "end": 816.12}, {"start": 816.12, "text": "这个水蒸气steam预冷就会干嘛?", "end": 819.71}, {"start": 819.71, "text": "凝固。", "end": 820.71}, {"start": 820.71, "text": "这个叫做turn into water.", "end": 823.14}, {"start": 823.14, "text": "The glass of the window is in front of the girl's mouth.", "end": 827.14}, {"start": 827.14, "text": "好,我们定位一下。", "end": 828.14}, {"start": 828.14, "text": "The glass of the window.", "end": 831.14}, {"start": 831.14, "text": "这里有四块glass, four pieces of glass, four parts of the window,对吧?", "end": 836.14}, {"start": 836.14, "text": "The glass of the window in front of the girl's mouth.", "end": 840.14}, {"start": 841.14, "text": "In front of the girl's mouth.", "end": 845.14}, {"start": 845.14, "text": "In front.", "end": 846.14}, {"start": 846.14, "text": "In the back.", "end": 847.14}, {"start": 847.14, "text": "On the left.", "end": 848.67}, {"start": 848.67, "text": "On the right.", "end": 849.67}, {"start": 849.67, "text": "对吧?", "end": 852.38}, {"start": 852.38, "text": "我们刚刚学过什么?", "end": 853.38}, {"start": 853.38, "text": "In front.", "end": 854.38}, {"start": 854.38, "text": "Front就是在她前面的地方。", "end": 857.38}, {"start": 857.38, "text": "So this is the front of teacher Eric.", "end": 859.38}, {"start": 859.38, "text": "This is the back of teacher Eric.", "end": 861.38}, {"start": 861.38, "text": "当然我的背就直接叫做back。", "end": 864.38}, {"start": 864.38, "text": "In front of the girl's mouth.", "end": 867.38}, {"start": 867.38, "text": "所以是什么?", "end": 868.38}, {"start": 868.38, "text": "在什么?", "end": 869.38}, {"start": 869.38, "text": "The girl's mouth的前面。", "end": 870.38}, {"start": 870.38, "text": "So in front of the girl's mouth has steam from her breath.", "end": 875.38}, {"start": 875.38, "text": "Has steam.", "end": 877.88}, {"start": 877.88, "text": "The glass of the window has steam.", "end": 879.88}, {"start": 879.88, "text": "What glass?", "end": 880.88}, {"start": 880.88, "text": "The glass of the window in front of the girl's mouth.", "end": 883.88}, {"start": 883.88, "text": "这一块glass, this glass has steam from her breath.", "end": 888.88}, {"start": 888.88, "text": "所以这个steam, steam, water, ice,对吧?", "end": 895.7}, {"start": 895.7, "text": "Has steam from her breath on it.", "end": 897.7}, {"start": 897.7, "text": "所以这个水气从哪来?", "end": 899.7}, {"start": 899.7, "text": "From the girl's breath onto the glass.", "end": 904.13}, {"start": 904.13, "text": "This piece of glass.", "end": 906.13}, {"start": 906.13, "text": "What piece of glass?", "end": 907.13}, {"start": 907.13, "text": "The glass in front of the girl's mouth.", "end": 910.13}, {"start": 910.13, "text": "In front of the girl's mouth.", "end": 912.13}, {"start": 912.13, "text": "This glass has steam.", "end": 915.13}, {"start": 915.13, "text": "Where is the steam from?", "end": 917.13}, {"start": 917.13, "text": "From the girl's breath.", "end": 918.13}, {"start": 918.13, "text": "The glass of the window in front of the girl's mouth has steam from her breath on it.", "end": 925.17}, {"start": 925.17, "text": "所以你说常句嘛。", "end": 927.17}, {"start": 927.17, "text": "你去背语法,去记啊。", "end": 929.17}, {"start": 929.17, "text": "怎么可能嘛?", "end": 930.17}, {"start": 930.17, "text": "常句在于理解,去衔接这些要素。", "end": 935.35}, {"start": 935.35, "text": "一句话可以无限长下去,尤其口语的时候。", "end": 938.35}, {"start": 938.35, "text": "我们边想边说,可以把一件事说得好长的,都不断句,对吧?", "end": 943.35}, {"start": 943.35, "text": "所以你们要回归到语意去感受就好了。", "end": 946.35}, {"start": 946.35, "text": "不要去想语法的问题。", "end": 948.35}, {"start": 948.35, "text": "你们经常问我常句的语法,我都懒得理你们。", "end": 951.35}, {"start": 951.35, "text": "She is making a mark on it.", "end": 954.35}, {"start": 954.35, "text": "What is she doing?", "end": 956.35}, {"start": 956.35, "text": "She is making,记得make嘛,对吧?", "end": 960.35}, {"start": 960.35, "text": "Mary is making soup, making.", "end": 964.2}, {"start": 964.2, "text": "She is making a mark, mark.", "end": 967.66}, {"start": 967.66, "text": "中国人讲马克,就是什么?", "end": 971.32}, {"start": 971.32, "text": "马克笔的mark,从哪里来的?", "end": 974.32}, {"start": 974.32, "text": "就是这个词mark。", "end": 975.32}, {"start": 975.32, "text": "你以为马克笔为什么叫马克笔?", "end": 978.32}, {"start": 978.32, "text": "你是不是以为是马克发明的?No。", "end": 980.32}, {"start": 980.32, "text": "是因为它可以去mark这个动作,标记就叫mark。", "end": 984.32}, {"start": 984.32, "text": "mark这个词的意思就是什么?标记。", "end": 987.32}, {"start": 987.32, "text": "你们在哪些地方会看到呢?", "end": 989.32}, {"start": 989.32, "text": "除了马克笔、marker pen,还有什么?", "end": 992.32}, {"start": 992.32, "text": "你们有没有看过很多以前的这个", "end": 995.46}, {"start": 995.46, "text": "英国佬、德国佬、美国佬", "end": 997.46}, {"start": 997.46, "text": "在第二次世界大战的时候武器的设计图?", "end": 1002.14}, {"start": 1002.14, "text": "一辆坦克一型叫做什么?", "end": 1004.14}, {"start": 1004.14, "text": "就是原名。", "end": 1006.14}, {"start": 1006.14, "text": "譬如说马杜撒坦克,Medusa tank。", "end": 1009.14}, {"start": 1009.14, "text": "好,如果是二型,那就叫什么?", "end": 1011.14}, {"start": 1011.14, "text": "Medusa Mark II。", "end": 1013.14}, {"start": 1013.14, "text": "意思是什么?设计师做的第二版。", "end": 1016.14}, {"start": 1016.14, "text": "Mark II,标记者2。", "end": 1018.14}, {"start": 1018.14, "text": "所以叫Mark II。", "end": 1020.14}, {"start": 1020.14, "text": "然后三型就是叫Mark III。", "end": 1023.14}, {"start": 1023.14, "text": "所以它指的是什么?", "end": 1025.14}, {"start": 1025.14, "text": "有标记一个另外一个数字的。", "end": 1027.14}, {"start": 1027.14, "text": "或者这里女生在做一个标记在窗上。", "end": 1030.14}, {"start": 1030.14, "text": "对吧?她这样。", "end": 1033.25}, {"start": 1033.25, "text": "And then mark it。", "end": 1035.25}, {"start": 1035.25, "text": "就这个道理。", "end": 1036.25}, {"start": 1036.25, "text": "所以mark是一个什么?标记的行为。", "end": 1038.25}, {"start": 1038.25, "text": "Making a mark on it with her finger。", "end": 1041.25}, {"start": 1041.25, "text": "finger。小女孩都会这样。", "end": 1043.87}, {"start": 1043.87, "text": "有没有?我们在画画,对吧?", "end": 1047.55}, {"start": 1047.55, "text": "She will put her name on the window。", "end": 1050.55}, {"start": 1050.55, "text": "那她标的这个mark是什么?", "end": 1052.55}, {"start": 1052.55, "text": "就是her name。", "end": 1054.55}, {"start": 1054.55, "text": "当然我们这里看不到她的name。", "end": 1056.55}, {"start": 1056.55, "text": "It's not important.", "end": 1057.55}, {"start": 1057.55, "text": "She will put, take, put, give。", "end": 1061.55}, {"start": 1061.55, "text": "想起来没?", "end": 1064.21}, {"start": 1064.21, "text": "She will put her name on the window.", "end": 1068.21}, {"start": 1068.21, "text": "Put her name on the window.", "end": 1070.21}, {"start": 1070.21, "text": "Question.", "end": 1072.5}, {"start": 1072.5, "text": "Where is the girl in the picture?", "end": 1074.5}, {"start": 1074.5, "text": "Where is she?", "end": 1075.97}, {"start": 1075.97, "text": "At a window.", "end": 1078.91}, {"start": 1078.91, "text": "In this picture, you see a girl at a window.", "end": 1081.91}, {"start": 1081.91, "text": "Where is the girl?", "end": 1082.91}, {"start": 1082.91, "text": "She is at a window.", "end": 1083.91}, {"start": 1083.91, "text": "注意Where指的是什么?", "end": 1085.91}, {"start": 1085.91, "text": "地点的代名词。", "end": 1086.91}, {"start": 1086.91, "text": "Is the glass of the window cold?", "end": 1089.91}, {"start": 1089.91, "text": "是吗?", "end": 1091.7}, {"start": 1091.7, "text": "The glass of the window cold。", "end": 1092.7}, {"start": 1092.7, "text": "那后面这个是不是现状?", "end": 1094.7}, {"start": 1094.7, "text": "或者是事实。", "end": 1095.7}, {"start": 1095.7, "text": "对吧?所以我们说is。", "end": 1096.7}, {"start": 1096.7, "text": "这是when的角度。", "end": 1097.7}, {"start": 1097.7, "text": "放在最前面。", "end": 1099.7}, {"start": 1099.7, "text": "Is the glass of the window cold?", "end": 1102.7}, {"start": 1102.7, "text": "Window的什么?", "end": 1103.7}, {"start": 1103.7, "text": "Glass.", "end": 1104.7}, {"start": 1104.7, "text": "Is the glass of the window cold?", "end": 1107.29}, {"start": 1107.29, "text": "Yes, it is.", "end": 1108.29}, {"start": 1108.29, "text": "It's very cold.", "end": 1109.29}, {"start": 1109.29, "text": "It's winter.", "end": 1110.29}, {"start": 1110.29, "text": "冬天怎么说?Winter, right?", "end": 1112.29}, {"start": 1112.29, "text": "Is the girl's breath turning to water on the cold glass of the window?", "end": 1116.29}, {"start": 1116.29, "text": "呃呃呃。", "end": 1117.29}, {"start": 1117.29, "text": "好长。我们慢下来。", "end": 1118.29}, {"start": 1118.29, "text": "Is。", "end": 1119.29}, {"start": 1119.29, "text": "是否。", "end": 1120.29}, {"start": 1120.29, "text": "对啊。这是不是存在状态?", "end": 1122.29}, {"start": 1122.29, "text": "这是这个问题的什么?", "end": 1123.29}, {"start": 1123.29, "text": "角度。", "end": 1124.29}, {"start": 1124.29, "text": "Is the girl's breath turning to water?", "end": 1128.29}, {"start": 1128.29, "text": "Turning to water.", "end": 1130.29}, {"start": 1130.29, "text": "From steam to water.", "end": 1132.29}, {"start": 1132.29, "text": "所以是turning to water on the cold glass of the window?", "end": 1137.29}, {"start": 1137.29, "text": "Yes, it is.", "end": 1139.29}, {"start": 1139.29, "text": "The girl's breath is turning to water on the cold glass of the window.", "end": 1145.29}, {"start": 1145.29, "text": "Is there steam on the glass of the window in front of the girl's mouth?", "end": 1150.29}, {"start": 1150.29, "text": "Is there steam on the glass?", "end": 1154.72}, {"start": 1154.72, "text": "慢慢想。", "end": 1155.72}, {"start": 1155.72, "text": "Steam on the glass.", "end": 1159.34}, {"start": 1159.34, "text": "Steam on the glass of the window in front of the girl's mouth?", "end": 1167.54}, {"start": 1167.54, "text": "我们看一下原文。", "end": 1168.54}, {"start": 1168.54, "text": "The glass of the window in front of the girl has steam from her breath on it.", "end": 1176.54}, {"start": 1176.54, "text": "所以这句就是原句了。", "end": 1178.54}, {"start": 1178.54, "text": "Yes, there is steam on the glass of the window in front of the girl's mouth.", "end": 1185.54}, {"start": 1185.54, "text": "对吧。", "end": 1186.97}, {"start": 1186.97, "text": "那里有。", "end": 1187.97}, {"start": 1187.97, "text": "这个有就是一个肯定的意思。", "end": 1189.97}, {"start": 1189.97, "text": "中国人说有就是指这个状态是肯定的。", "end": 1193.97}, {"start": 1193.97, "text": "所以there is steam on the glass.", "end": 1198.56}, {"start": 1198.56, "text": "后面陈述一个事实就好了。", "end": 1200.56}, {"start": 1200.56, "text": "What is the girl doing?", "end": 1203.6}, {"start": 1203.6, "text": "What is she doing?", "end": 1204.6}, {"start": 1204.6, "text": "She is marking her name on the window.", "end": 1209.6}, {"start": 1209.6, "text": "在马克什么?", "end": 1210.6}, {"start": 1210.6, "text": "Her name on the window.", "end": 1213.6}, {"start": 1213.6, "text": "当然这句话有更长的版本。", "end": 1215.6}, {"start": 1215.6, "text": "我们看一下拼写跟答案都在这里。", "end": 1219.1}, {"start": 1219.1, "text": "我们把读跟写也综合一下。", "end": 1222.1}, {"start": 1222.1, "text": "这些题有时候瑞杰老师在讲解的时候,你也可以写写看。", "end": 1226.1}, {"start": 1226.1, "text": "你就当画画。", "end": 1227.1}, {"start": 1226.6, "text": "在照片中,女孩在窗戶中。", "end": 1231.6}, {"start": 1231.6, "text": "女孩在窗戶中。", "end": 1233.6}, {"start": 1233.6, "text": "女孩在窗戶中。", "end": 1235.6}, {"start": 1235.6, "text": "窗戶的玻璃冷吗?", "end": 1238.6}, {"start": 1238.6, "text": "是的,窗戶的玻璃冷。", "end": 1241.6}, {"start": 1241.6, "text": "女孩的呼吸在窗戶的玻璃上变水了吗?", "end": 1245.6}, {"start": 1245.6, "text": "是的,女孩的呼吸在窗戶的玻璃上变水了。", "end": 1251.6}, {"start": 1251.6, "text": "是在窗戶的玻璃上冒煙嗎?", "end": 1254.08}, {"start": 1254.52, "text": "在女生的嘴巴前面嗎?", "end": 1256.36}, {"start": 1256.31, "text": "Yes, there is steam on the glass of the window in front of the girl's mouth.", "end": 1261.31}, {"start": 1256.36, "text": "是的", "end": 1256.86}, {"start": 1261.31, "text": "What is the girl doing?", "end": 1263.1}, {"start": 1263.1, "text": "She is making a mark on it with her finger.", "end": 1270.1}, {"start": 1270.1, "text": "做一个标记。", "end": 1271.1}, {"start": 1271.1, "text": "瑞杰老师直接说什么?", "end": 1273.1}, {"start": 1273.1, "text": "标记她的名字。", "end": 1274.1}, {"start": 1274.1, "text": "Mark her name.", "end": 1275.1}, {"start": 1275.1, "text": "Making a name on it with her finger.", "end": 1277.1}, {"start": 1277.1, "text": "With 伴随或在一起。", "end": 1280.1}, {"start": 1280.1, "text": "With her finger.", "end": 1281.1}, {"start": 1282.1, "text": "你当然这里人跟手指有可能形成更具体的关系。", "end": 1285.1}, {"start": 1285.1, "text": "譬如用手指。", "end": 1287.1}, {"start": 1287.1, "text": "那就是什么?", "end": 1288.1}, {"start": 1288.1, "text": "Use her finger.", "end": 1289.1}, {"start": 1289.1, "text": "She is making a mark on it using her finger.", "end": 1294.62}, {"start": 1294.62, "text": "She is using her finger to make a mark on it.", "end": 1298.62}, {"start": 1298.62, "text": "Or to mark her name.", "end": 1299.62}, {"start": 1299.62, "text": "所以你看语言也没定式。", "end": 1301.62}, {"start": 1301.62, "text": "你们开始可以自由回答了。", "end": 1303.62}, {"start": 1303.62, "text": "别老想我一定有一个标准答案。", "end": 1306.62}, {"start": 1306.62, "text": "但是核心要素不能丢。", "end": 1308.62}, {"start": 1308.62, "text": "包括你们考生做阅读题的时候。", "end": 1310.62}, {"start": 1310.62, "text": "很多题本质也就是这个意思。", "end": 1313.62}, {"start": 1313.62, "text": "你能不能从阅读中得到核心信息。", "end": 1316.62}, {"start": 1316.62, "text": "所以你们要很注意什么核心信息这个概念。", "end": 1319.62}, {"start": 1319.62, "text": "但我不是说语言要多么的跟答案一模一样。", "end": 1322.62}, {"start": 1322.62, "text": "这个不是考点。", "end": 1324.62}, {"start": 1324.62, "text": "所以其他人也注意这点。", "end": 1326.62}, {"start": 1326.62, "text": "好。", "end": 1328.78}, {"start": 1328.78, "text": "作为漫长的一次大复习课。", "end": 1331.78}, {"start": 1331.78, "text": "这个25节是一次巨型的对前面24节的大整合。", "end": 1336.78}, {"start": 1336.78, "text": "所以我说过什么?", "end": 1337.78}, {"start": 1337.78, "text": "课程会一直反复。", "end": 1339.78}, {"start": 1339.78, "text": "你们只要耐心的往前走。", "end": 1341.78}, {"start": 1341.78, "text": "别去纠结。", "end": 1343.78}, {"start": 1343.78, "text": "这个可以看三年的东西。", "end": 1345.78}, {"start": 1345.78, "text": "不用纠结一个礼拜。", "end": 1348.37}, {"start": 1348.37, "text": "用英语描述做西红柿蛋汤的详细步骤。", "end": 1352.37}, {"start": 1352.37, "text": "How to make tomato and egg soup。", "end": 1354.37}, {"start": 1354.37, "text": "我们先用简单的版本。", "end": 1356.37}, {"start": 1356.37, "text": "因为这个内容后面会系统性的学习。", "end": 1358.37}, {"start": 1358.37, "text": "简单的版本。", "end": 1360.93}, {"start": 1360.93, "text": "我们从头说起。", "end": 1361.93}, {"start": 1361.93, "text": "首先我们需要什么?", "end": 1363.93}, {"start": 1363.93, "text": "we", "end": 1364.93}, {"start": 1364.93, "text": "或者I need", "end": 1366.93}, {"start": 1366.93, "text": "或者need都不用说了。", "end": 1368.93}, {"start": 1368.93, "text": "I take a bowl.", "end": 1371.94}, {"start": 1371.94, "text": "这是bowl。", "end": 1372.94}, {"start": 1372.94, "text": "当然你要说plate也行吧。", "end": 1374.94}, {"start": 1374.94, "text": "我们原尾用了plate这个词。", "end": 1376.94}, {"start": 1376.94, "text": "瑞杰老师觉得这是个碗。", "end": 1378.94}, {"start": 1378.94, "text": "I get a bowl.", "end": 1380.94}, {"start": 1380.94, "text": "不对。", "end": 1381.94}, {"start": 1381.94, "text": "那是吃饭啊。", "end": 1382.94}, {"start": 1382.94, "text": "所以我要先干嘛。", "end": 1383.94}, {"start": 1383.94, "text": "Get a pot.", "end": 1384.94}, {"start": 1384.94, "text": "一个锅。", "end": 1385.94}, {"start": 1385.94, "text": "I get a pot.", "end": 1388.23}, {"start": 1388.23, "text": "And some eggs.", "end": 1391.72}, {"start": 1391.72, "text": "或者a few eggs。", "end": 1392.72}, {"start": 1392.72, "text": "也可以some eggs。", "end": 1393.72}, {"start": 1393.72, "text": "一些蛋。", "end": 1395.18}, {"start": 1395.18, "text": "And some tomatoes.", "end": 1399.03}, {"start": 1399.03, "text": "这个词就学过。", "end": 1401.03}, {"start": 1401.03, "text": "I crack the egg.", "end": 1403.03}, {"start": 1403.03, "text": "我也可以直接把蛋液弄到汤里面。", "end": 1406.03}, {"start": 1406.03, "text": "I crack the egg.", "end": 1407.03}, {"start": 1407.03, "text": "And put it in some water.", "end": 1410.78}, {"start": 1410.78, "text": "And then I cut some.", "end": 1411.78}, {"start": 1411.78, "text": "Then I cut some tomatoes.", "end": 1414.4}, {"start": 1414.4, "text": "And put them in the water.", "end": 1417.31}, {"start": 1417.31, "text": "当然西红柿应该先炖。", "end": 1419.31}, {"start": 1419.31, "text": "So I put the tomatoes in first.", "end": 1421.31}, {"start": 1421.31, "text": "And boil them.", "end": 1422.78}, {"start": 1422.78, "text": "想起来了没有。", "end": 1423.78}, {"start": 1423.78, "text": "I turn on the fire.", "end": 1425.78}, {"start": 1425.78, "text": "And use the flame.", "end": 1427.78}, {"start": 1427.78, "text": "火焰。", "end": 1429.27}, {"start": 1429.27, "text": "To boil the water.", "end": 1433.43}, {"start": 1433.43, "text": "The water gets very hot.", "end": 1435.43}, {"start": 1435.43, "text": "Then I put the", "end": 1437.9}, {"start": 1437.9, "text": "tomatoes in the water.", "end": 1439.9}, {"start": 1439.9, "text": "And boil them.", "end": 1440.9}, {"start": 1440.9, "text": "After this.", "end": 1444.7}, {"start": 1444.7, "text": "I put the eggs in.", "end": 1446.7}, {"start": 1446.7, "text": "And quickly boil the eggs.", "end": 1449.74}, {"start": 1449.74, "text": "当然这里补充要什么。", "end": 1452.49}, {"start": 1452.49, "text": "加一点盐。", "end": 1453.95}, {"start": 1453.95, "text": "Before I'm finished.", "end": 1455.95}, {"start": 1455.95, "text": "I will put some salt in.", "end": 1457.95}, {"start": 1457.95, "text": "And there I have some Chinese egg soup.", "end": 1460.95}, {"start": 1460.95, "text": "当然我说真的。", "end": 1461.95}, {"start": 1461.95, "text": "作为一个老外。", "end": 1462.95}, {"start": 1462.95, "text": "我是觉得西红柿蛋汤。", "end": 1464.95}, {"start": 1464.95, "text": "除了有点营养以外。", "end": 1465.95}, {"start": 1465.95, "text": "是真的很一般的东西。", "end": 1467.95}, {"start": 1467.95, "text": "西红柿。", "end": 1468.95}, {"start": 1468.95, "text": "的尊者。", "end": 1469.95}, {"start": 1469.95, "text": "王者。", "end": 1470.95}, {"start": 1470.95, "text": "还是地中海系的菜系。", "end": 1472.95}, {"start": 1472.95, "text": "尤其是意大利菜。", "end": 1474.95}, {"start": 1474.95, "text": "他们会干嘛。", "end": 1475.95}, {"start": 1475.95, "text": "长时间高压的去炖西红柿。", "end": 1477.95}, {"start": 1477.95, "text": "把它做一个很稠的汤。", "end": 1479.95}, {"start": 1479.95, "text": "或者酱汁。", "end": 1481.95}, {"start": 1481.95, "text": "那种西红柿浓汤。", "end": 1483.95}, {"start": 1483.95, "text": "比这个好喝多了。", "end": 1485.95}]}